    "title": "Cross Stitch Joy",
    "description": "Easy, relaxing and free coloring game.\r\nBut Cross Stitch is \"coloring\" with needles and threads of different colors. \r\n\r\nCross Stitch Joy create a joyful life to you!\r\nCross Stitching on your phone anytime and anywhere!\r\nIt\u2019s almost the best choice for the family time!\r\nConcentrate on it, cross stitching the Landscapes, Famous Buildings, Famous Paintings or import your friends photos. Just enjoy the leisure time with it.\r\n\r\n< Cross Stitching friends photos >\r\nImport a photos, Cross Stitching it and made the photos are unique.\r\n\r\n< Updated the new pictures weekly >\r\nThere\u2019re lots of interesting pictures: Landscapes, Famous Buildings, Famous Paintings, Pets\u2026.and more.\r\nAnd we provide more choice for you each week!\r\n\r\nNo age limited, the best choice for family time!\r\nWhat are you waiting for? It's time to download and try it now\uff01",
